    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44263" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sĭlīgĭnĕus</span></b>  (late form
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sĭlīgnus</span></b> ,
		Dynam. 1, 7), adj.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of wheat</i>, <i>wheaten</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">farina,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cato, R. R. 121</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 18, 9, 20, § 88</span></i>: panis,
			Varr. ap. <i><span class="en">Non. 88, 14</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen. Ep.
				123, 2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vop. Aurel. 35</span></i>:
			cunni, i. e. <i>wheaten loaves</i> of obscene form,
				<i><span class="en">Mart.
				9, 3, 3</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Priapus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					14, 69</span></i>
			
			<i>in lemm.</i></div>
